WEBVTT

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.000
Mimi...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.990
In Use

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.200
Wait!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.690
What's going on?

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.610
Where are you taking her?!

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.970
She's an enemy. She can't stay in our base.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.720
She's not! And she hasn't even 
regained consciousness yet!

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.340
Need I remind you how 
many fragments she stole?

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:44.240
Even so, Yayaka's my friend!

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:50.060
I agree with letting her stay, Dr. Salt.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:51.860
At least until we're done treating her...

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.520
Salt-san!

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:57.870
She has until morning.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.500
Get her to a room at once!

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:23.780
All the amorphous have been 
brought out of Pure Illusion.

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:25.350
I confirmed!

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:30.060
We'll commence the operation 
as soon as Yayaka's located.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:31.620
But Toto's still...

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.130
There'll be no change in plans.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:35.150
Understood.

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:36.890
How about me?

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:38.520
Be on standby.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:41.160
Boring! I wanna go, too!

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:42.840
This is an order.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:45.910
Fine.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:51.680
The time of rebirth and 
liberation is upon us.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.170
Cocona, we need to talk...

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.200
This place again...

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:43.610
Welcome back.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.540
Just who are you?

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.750
I'm...

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:56.000
Mimi.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.050
Papika.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.470
Mimi...

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:12.670
Huh?

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.660
Too bad! It was me!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.180
Cocona?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.860
Cocona, wait!

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.900
Tell me about Mimi-san, then.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.140
Mimi's...

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:30.440
Let me go.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.540
I have to go see Yayaka.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:43.160
But telling you would only make you sad.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:46.430
Bu-chan?

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.430
Capture

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.640
Wait, what?

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:53.420
Bu-chan!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:04.010
Has she hit the rebellious phase?

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:30.900
Ow...

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:32.880
Too rough, Bu-chan!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.640
We need to talk...

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:37.890
Papikana.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.490
I'm Papika now.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:44.030
So you have regained your memories, Papikana.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.580
You've gotten meaner, Salt.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.950
And you haven't changed.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:53.700
What is that creepy thing?

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.070
Yayaka!

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:56.650
Thank goodness!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.620
You can't get up yet.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:02.080
Doesn't the sunglasses dude want me out?

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.640
I'll ask him to let you stay.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.920
Besides, look.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.850
Sayuri-san got you flowers.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.440
The vase is from Hidaka-san...

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.390
Huh?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.610
And this is from me.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.990
Please, stay here.

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.520
I'm your enemy.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.530
But you protected me.

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:32.320
Only until I'm done eating, okay?

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.160
Okay.

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:39.490
Did you pull an all-nighter?

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:40.800
But of course!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:42.880
How is it going?

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.920
Everything's ready!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.920
Now to see it in action!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:50.300
Uh, what about Cocona-chan?

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.300
She'll take care of her.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.150
Are you okay?

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:58.150
Man, they didn't hold back.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:01.020
Aren't they your partners?

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.400
That's what they were created for.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.800
They're kids who were genetically programmed

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:12.100
with amorphous powers in 
order to go to Pure Illusion.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:13.780
And you?

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.910
I had them implanted in me later.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.490
Are there others?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.220
There were,

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:25.660
but they were all incompatible, so they...

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:30.300
I'm the only one who survived.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:36.780
And yet they treat me like trash because 
I can't find amorphous by myself.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.760
It's just not fair.

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:42.690
Wherever you two go, 
there's always an amorphous.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.390
Why would you go so far to collect fragments?

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:47.650
If you collect all the amorphous,

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.940
you can rule Pure Illusion.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.340
I was told they grant wishes.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.070
I guess I can't exactly call that a lie.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:59.380
If you can bend Pure Illusion to your will,

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.050
you can do whatever you want.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:02.960
That's messed up.

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:05.130
Just for that, you'd...

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.470
I believed in the mission.

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:13.840
If it brought about a world where 
nobody had to get hurt or hurt others...

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:17.010
If choosing my rightful 
place meant losing it,

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:22.530
I thought I'd be much happier letting 
someone make the choice for me.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:25.910
Sorry.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:29.110
I had no idea.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:32.610
You're fine as you are.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:37.620
We're probably the ones in the wrong.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.440
Thanks.

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:43.320
I'm glad you're my friend.

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:46.870
Yayaka?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.460
I'm gonna be straight with you.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.010
I...

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.650
Large number of enemies detected!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.140
Draw them to the Thomasson Area.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:08.150
Sure thing!

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:19.830
Like moths to a flame!

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.510
Wha... Oh.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.180
The target?

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.210
That way.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.260
Shortest route is...

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:31.960
Shortest.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:43.710
Welcome.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.400
There's no end to them!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.410
Hold out somehow.

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:04.080
Wha...

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.000
Sounds like big trouble.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:07.880
Go ahead, Cocona.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.370
I'm not leaving you behind.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.960
Just go.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.400
Remember what I told you?

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.280
My mindset is totally unlike yours.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.300
But...

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:17.420
Tch.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.990
Found Yayaka.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.510
Target with her.

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.020
Cocona!

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.140
Run!

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.240
Cocona-oneechan.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:30.650
Come with us.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.160
Me?

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.070
Why?

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.610
Don't listen to them!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.190
You don't know?

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:39.880
Will tell you.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.070
Inside you...

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.350
is an amorphous.

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:49.880
You really didn't know?

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.090
That's why Yayaka watched you all this time.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.470
Pretended to meet you by chance.

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:01.190
More convenient that way.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.600
What do you mean?

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.580
You were deceived.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:06.970
Softie.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:09.050
That's a lie...

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:10.610
Right?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.180
No way.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.090
Cocona!

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:24.990
Run!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.790
You hop on too, Yayaka.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.390
Forget me! Just go!

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.120
Not getting away.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.030
You get to play with me.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.900
We're almost out.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:54.860
...me off.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:58.360
Let me off.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:11:59.360
Why?

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.500
Let me off!

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.450
What's wrong, Cocona?

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.140
We need to run!

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.710
Salt asked me

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:15.660
to protect you and Mimi's fragments.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:16.710
Look.

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:19.710
Mimi's fragments?

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:20.880
Yeah.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:23.680
Yet another thing only I'm in the dark about?

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:30.080
You dragged me into this mess, saying you 
couldn't go to Pure Illusion without me.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:33.590
I never wanted to go on 
any adventures, you know.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.470
You deceived me...

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:37.730
No, I didn't!

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:39.480
Then tell me!

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:41.200
Who is Mimi?!

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:43.980
Well...

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:48.460
I know nothing about Mimi-san.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:52.370
And yet she even shows up in my dreams.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.940
I feel so stupid.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:59.300
Mimi's my partner...

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:03.100
and a precious friend of mine.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.190
Candidate 45, it's time to go.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:17.940
Okay!

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:23.070
Another one...

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:25.330
Same as the others...

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:29.590
Nobody who's been taken to Mimi's 
room has ever come back.

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.460
Mimi, huh?

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.580
I hope we can be friends.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.130
Who's that, Dad?

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:50.540
That's the 33—

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:53.060
No, we call her Mimi.

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:57.190
She's the only one who 
can go to Pure Illusion.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:13:59.440
Mimi...

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:01.510
What's the matter? Let's go.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:04.230
Yeah.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.890
<i>The next partner candidate is here.</i>

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:12.730
Hollo!

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:19.540
Papikana.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.390
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.110
Weird name.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.020
What? Is it?

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.630
It's hard to say.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.510
Then call me whatever you like.

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:33.030
Never mind.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.100
She smelled so nice.

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:46.160
I hope I can see her again.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:54.670
Sniff, sniff.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:01.780
Who's there?

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.930
Ow...

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:05.960
Papikana.

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:08.030
What a weird name.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:10.090
Who're you?

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:13.220
I'm... Salt.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.250
What a weird outfit.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.680
This is...

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.230
I'm still a trainee.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:20.660
Salt.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:22.950
Where do I have to go to see Mimi?

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.650
You know her?

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.870
Yeah. We're friends...

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:29.400
Or will be, I hope.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.710
I want to be her friend, too...

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:35.310
Salt, what was that noise earlier?

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:37.280
Nothing, Dad.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:42.290
A lake?

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:45.290
It's <i>this</i> big!

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:47.000
And it's all water!

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.710
That can't be true.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.510
Nobody can drink that much.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.900
It's true.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:54.180
I saw it while being brought here.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.760
There were white flowers, and...

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.060
Flowers?

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.660
You've never seen flowers?

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.600
Are there any here?

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.440
Nope.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:08.360
Well, this room is all I know.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.600
But you know the outside world.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.030
I envy you.

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:18.240
Let's go adventuring together!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.660
I bet it'll be fun!

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:21.600
Someday.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:24.300
It's a promise, okay, Papika?

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.320
Okay!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.300
We haven't detected any change in impedance.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:31.210
I see.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.800
Shall we move on to the next candidate?

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:37.420
Can I take that as a yes?

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:39.810
Get things ready.

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:42.320
Salt!

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:45.200
You sneaked out again?

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.060
I need a favor!

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:53.830
It really is big.

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:54.600
Right?

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.070
And it's all sparkly.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:01.080
Thank you for keeping your promise.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:04.590
Salt asked his father for us.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.960
Thank you, Salt.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:10.050
S-Sure.

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:12.090
Though I couldn't get you much time.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.090
Like it?

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:19.290
How strange.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:21.620
They're carrots, but they're sweet and tasty.

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.390
It's Papikana's Special Carrot Gra...

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:26.200
Gra...

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.710
Gragra?

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:28.970
What was it, again?

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.240
Here.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.120
Put it here.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.170
So this is how flowers smell.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.280
I'm so happy.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:49.820
You finally smiled!

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:54.940
Now it's my turn to show you...

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:58.270
A world only I know.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:13.450
Papika.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:18.270
This feels great!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:25.830
Mimi took me to Pure Illusion.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:26.670
Mimi's—

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:27.710
Enough.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:29.990
Cocona?

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:31.330
I've had enough!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.360
You see me as just a substitute 
for Mimi-san, don't you?

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.940
Because you can go to Pure Illusion with me?

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:37.400
No—

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:40.170
Because there's a fragment inside me?!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.180
I like you for you!

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:46.100
In truth, anybody would've done.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.060
Cocona, listen to me!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:51.770
The people of FlipFlap,

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.020
Yayaka,

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:54.560
and you...

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.380
I hate you all.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.030
Cocona!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:05.540
Cocona!

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:11.040
Cocona!

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:13.710
Cocona!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.230
Cocona-chan and Papika have broken out.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:20.360
Abandon the base.

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.060
I'm sick of it all.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:33.770
Cocona!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:37.220
Cocona!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.800
Welcome back.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:49.660
I'm home.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.400
I look awful.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.410
Grandma, I'm fine now...

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.670
Grandma, run away—

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:11.890
Grandma...

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.640
You're standing...

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.730
I'm sorry.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.430
What do you mean?

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:22.650
Seize her.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.410
No!

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:28.850
Why?

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:31.550
Don't hurt her too much.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.640
It was all a lie.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.680
You're a very good girl,

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.680
so you'll forgive me, won't you?

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.630
It can't be...

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.290
It can't be!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.100
Why?

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.220
It's all right, Cocona.

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:11.540
No!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:55.440
Mom will protect you from now on,

00:21:57.340 --> 00:21:58.410
Cocona.

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:34.860
"Next time" refers to the future, 
which is a fluid and indefinite concept.

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:37.880
As such, previews of "next time" do not exist.

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.430
Pure Storage

00:23:37.880 --> 00:23:38.830
QED.
